    <string name="privacy_how_title">How your input is protected</string>
    <string name="privacy_how_body">Everything you type or do is encrypted between this phone and the PC with a key only the two of them have. Nobody else on the network can read it or add to it. Each PC is trusted only after you confirm its fingerprint.</string>
